Z||000000||2xsess||10-09-2000||12:48 AM||||Is it possible to use an SE rear bumper cover with a fastback clip? I don't see any major difference except the molding.<P>TIA<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||5
Z||000001||mrfiero||10-09-2000||12:52 AM||||You can use ANY Fiero rear bumper that you want......I think it would look odd with a coupe bumper cover, but that's my opinion.<P>An '86 SE cover will look the same, except the molding, but I'm assuming the rest of the car will have the ribbed molding anyways, so no biggie there.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||1FieroGTRacingInc||10-09-2000||01:00 AM||||I saw a GT conversion the other day on my way to work, with a SE rear fascia..  looked ........   Different.<BR>If you want a Fiero that would be different then try it with the SE fascia, and see how you like it....      Steve||||reg||1
